<title>CYPRUS: SOCCER-CYPRUS BEAT ISRAEL 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CYPRUS BEAT ISRAEL 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus beat Israel 2-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in their World Cup European group five qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Sinica Gogic 9, 15 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Group five standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Russia		 3   2   1   0   9   1   7</p>
<p> Israel		 3   1   1   1   3   4   4</p>
<p> Bulgaria	     2   1   0   1   3   3   3</p>
<p> Cyprus		 2   1   0   1   2   4   3</p>
<p> Luxembourg	   2   0   0   2   1   6   0</p>
<p>Next matches: Dec 14 Cyprus v Bulgaria, Dec 15 Israel v</p>
<p>Luxembourg</p>
</text>
